+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * Ingenic ISVP-T30N, DFU/USB-boot loader variant (DDR2 64 MB, CPU 864 MHz).
+ * Per-variant: brings up DDR with the T30N clocks/geometry so the loader
+ * matches the target; do not reuse a loader across variants.
+ */
