+/*
+ * MSCnCDR layout: [31:30] source select (0 APLL, 1 MPLL, 2 VPLL),
+ * [29] CE (apply, left set by the vendor), [28] BUSY, [27] STOP,
+ * [7:0] div; rate = src / ((div+1)*2).
