+	  Ingenic XBurst1 SoCs (T10/T20/T21/T23/T30/T31/T32/C100) have
+	  an AIC controller with an on-chip audio codec. This enables
+	  PIO playback (no DMA) through the AIC and the UCLASS_I2S +
