+	bool "Ingenic XBurst1 on-chip audio codec (jz_t10 family)"
+	depends on I2S_INGENIC
+	help
+	  The on-chip audio codec in Ingenic T10/T20/T21/T23/T30/T31/
+	  C100, driven by direct MMIO. Provides DAC -> speaker playback
+	  for the `sound` command. Not for T32 - that SoC has a
+	  different codec block; use SOUND_T32_CODEC instead.
+
+config SOUND_T32_CODEC
+	bool "Ingenic T32 on-chip audio codec"
+	depends on I2S_INGENIC
+	help
+	  The on-chip audio codec in Ingenic T32 - a different silicon
+	  block from the T10..T31 jz_t10 family (different register
+	  set, codec base 0x10021000). Provides DAC -> speaker
+	  playback for the `sound` command.
